  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Earmarked contribution to Centre for Humanitarian Dialogue (HD) 2024-2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Under HD&#x2019;s Global strategy 2024-2027, HD will help prevent, mitigate and resolve armed conflict through dialogue and mediation. Specifically through: 1) Mediation and dialogue facilitation with and between conflict parties; 2) Mediation support to other mediators and intermediaries in peace processes; 3) Peace negotiation support to prepare conflict parties and stakeholders to talks and advance negotiations; and 4) Informal diplomacy to increase peaceful cooperation between states and prevent conflict, or its escalation.</narrative>
  </description>
